   "originalText": "TWO federated clients:\n\n  delegation-broker\n    = the BROKER, bound to the\n      gateway's SPIFFE ID\n\n  spiffe://\u2026/sa/\u2026-openshell-sandbox\n    = the AGENT, bound to the\n      sandbox's SPIFFE ID",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
