   "id": "e31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 446,
   "y": 1036.0,
   "width": 342.16,
   "height": 146.25,
   "text": "mcp-authz-policy on listener `mcps`\n\nAUTHENTICATION (rules are OR-ed)\n  anonymous   when no x-mcp-toolname\n  realm JWT   when x-mcp-toolname present\n\nAUTHORIZATION  tool-access-check (AND-ed)\n  ('tool:'+toolname) in resource_access[server]\n  azp == 'spiffe://\u2026/sa/\u2026-openshell-sandbox'",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "mcp-authz-policy on listener `mcps`\n\nAUTHENTICATION (rules are OR-ed)\n  anonymous   when no x-mcp-toolname\n  realm JWT   when x-mcp-toolname present\n\nAUTHORIZATION  tool-access-check (AND-ed)\n  ('tool:'+toolname) in resource_access[server]\n  azp == 'spiffe://\u2026/sa/\u2026-openshell-sandbox'",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
